{"4226750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Intergalactic Cleaning Squad", "steam_appid": 4226750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Someone's gotta mop up this mess. Might as well be you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe has a bit of a problem - 25 levels worth of monsters, creeps, and cosmic troublemakers who clearly didn't get the memo about keeping things tidy.  <br> <br>Enter the <strong>Intergalactic Cleaning Squad</strong>: three fearless fighters armed to the teeth and ready to scrub the galaxy clean. No refunds. No Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/2ea7de9930ce84ec907625346a53599e.poster.avif?t=1767686707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/2ea7de9930ce84ec907625346a53599e.webm?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through increasingly chaotic battles, unlock 15 upgrades to turn your squad into an unstoppable sanitation crew, and restore peace one exploding enemy at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/03c5a5bbca32627034a198308d961d5b.poster.avif?t=1767686707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/03c5a5bbca32627034a198308d961d5b.webm?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/03c5a5bbca32627034a198308d961d5b.mp4?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too tired to save the universe yourself? No judgment. Flip on idle mode, grab a snack, and watch your squad handle the dirty work automatically. They're professionals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/ea6218669a755872ea3e43a11564d040.poster.avif?t=1767686707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/ea6218669a755872ea3e43a11564d040.webm?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/ea6218669a755872ea3e43a11564d040.mp4?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels of fast-paced, arcade-style extermination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 upgrades to customize your cleaning loadout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish 2D isometric pixel art with optional retro vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT shading options for that authentic &quot;found this in my grandpa's basement&quot; look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack that slaps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle/Automatic mode for the strategically lazy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 11 languages (aliens not included)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/cda168de14533f839385ba610ba97