cally lazy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 11 languages (aliens not included)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/cda168de14533f839385ba610ba97418.poster.avif?t=1767686707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/cda168de14533f839385ba610ba97418.webm?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/extras/cda168de14533f839385ba610ba97418.mp4?t=1767686707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The galaxy's not gonna clean itself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Meet Zephyra, Robuddy and Niles in this tactical arcade space action clicker game! Can you defeat all 25 levels of interplanetary evil and restore peace in the universe?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/930888d00829765c9bff38243c5ae3c3ec79a907/header.jpg?t=1767686707", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/70e1faba18d11b0f1caec3c1620744c764843c47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767686707", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226750/70e1faba18d11b0f1caec3c1620744c764843c47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767686707", "website": "https://www.rigid-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</